        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\n\nTWO BEDROOM APARTMENT IN DUBLIN 7\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings is delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment to the market, superbly located in the ever-popular Amiens Square on Amiens Street, Dublin 1.\n\nThis modern property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers an ideal opportunity for those looking for comfortable living in the heart of the city.The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a light-filled kitchen/living area, two bedrooms, and a main bathroom.\n\nThe location is truly second to none. Positioned just moments from Connolly Station, Busáras, and a wide range of Dublin Bus routes, tenants can enjoy exceptional transport links across the city and beyond. The IFSC, Docklands, O'Connell Street, Trinity College, and an array of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and leisure amenities are all within easy walking distance. Popular attractions such as EPIC The Irish Emigration Museum and Croke Park are also close by.\n\n<u>Key Features:</u>\n<ul>\n <li>Connolly station within 2 minutes' walk</li>\n <li>Short walk to the Luas</li>\n <li>The IFSC and Grand Canal Dock close by</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
